{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果在美國智能手機市場持續收縮之際進一步擴大領先優勢。市場研究機構Counterpoint Research發佈的最新數據顯示，今年第三季度，也就是7月至9月，美國智能手機整體出貨量同比下降9%。該機構認為，全球存儲晶片供應緊張是主要拖累因素，而Android陣營，尤其是低端機型，受到的衝擊最為明顯。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587286.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:43:57.626743+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:23:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_hash":"493601b9ee832243f5d4ac7082d23fa0405ddc4ad07a9dac1e4db6df456a5508","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}